    </div>

    <div class="bg-gray-900 border border-gray-800 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4"><span class="text-2xl font-bold">4.4/5</span><span class="text-gray-500">Developer Rating</span></div>
      <p class="text-gray-300">Netcup is a German provider known for strong hardware value: the current G12 VPS line pairs KVM virtualization with DDR5 ECC RAM, NVMe storage, flatrate traffic, snapshots, and a backup system. It is one of the most popular budget KVM options in the European self-hosting community.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2">Best value: VPS 1000 G12 at €10.37/mo (4 vCore, 8GB DDR5 ECC, 256GB NVMe)</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-8">
      <div><h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-green-400">Pros</h2><ul class="space-y-2">
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Strong hardware per euro — DDR5 ECC RAM on every G12 plan</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Flatrate traffic included on all VPS plans</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Snapshots (Copy-On-Write) and a backup system built in</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ IPv4 + IPv6 /64 included at no extra cost; Cloud vLAN option</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 5 datacenter locations: Vienna, Nuremberg, Amsterdam, Manassas, Singapore</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ Hourly billing available; PayPal, credit card, SEPA accepted</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">✅ 30-day satisfaction guarantee on new orders</li>
      </ul></div>
      <div><h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 text-red-400">Cons</h2><ul class="space-y-2">
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Several configs require a 12-month minimum contract</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Fair-use throttle: sustained >2 TB/24h on the entry plan drops to 200 Mbit/s</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Support is ticket-based; no phone line, German-first culture</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ ARM64 VPS tier is frequently sold out</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Not a managed service — you handle the OS, updates, and security</li>
        <li class="text-gray-300 text-sm">⚠️ Prices shown include VAT, so non-EU buyers see a lower checkout total</li>
      </ul></div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-gray-800 pt-8 mb-8"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Netcup VPS Pricing (G12, verified 2026-08)</h2><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="w-full text-sm"><thead><tr class="border-b border-gray-700 text-gray-400"><th class="text-left py-3 pr-4">Plan</th><th class="text-left py-3 pr-4">vCore</th><th class="text-left py-3 pr-4">RAM</th><th class="text-left py-3 pr-4">Storage</th><th class="text-left py-3 pr-4">Price</th></tr></thead><tbody>
